  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In a Western Desert sand tunnel near a tributary of the River of Time, Feng Jiu Ge fights under silence surpasses sound. He has practised only two of the three methods so far, using them to cover battle shortages outside his seven songs; the third remains unlearned.",
