    },
    {
      "text": "During the assault on Lang Ya blessed land, Feng Jiu Ge answers the silver giant with immortal killer move Triple Extreme Sound: fist for drumming, palm for bell chimes, and finger for a sharp whistle, the signature methods of Three Sounds true inheritance. After Fang Yuan escaped an earlier pursuit, Feng Jiu Ge returned to Central Continent, cultivated the missing whistle finger, and formed Triple Extreme Sound from all three methods.",
